### Requests for the Docker demo (VS Code REST Client or IntelliJ HTTP Client).
### OIE's HTTPS API uses a self-signed certificate.

@oru = http://localhost:10807/oru/
@patient = http://localhost:10817/patient-compare/
@labo = http://localhost:10811/labo/
@sqlPatient = http://localhost:10812/sql-patient/
@csvCollection = http://localhost:10806/csv-patients-collection/
@organizationR5 = http://localhost:10810/organization-r5/
@frCorePatient = http://localhost:10801/pid-fr-core-ins/
@fhirPatient = http://localhost:10802/fhir-patient/
@dynamicAdt = http://localhost:10818/adt-dynamic-fml/
@oie = https://localhost:8443/api
@auth = Basic admin:admin
@channel = 5d0f6c2a-8b3e-4f1a-9c7d-2e6b1a0f3c48
@ig = /fhir-volume/shared/lab-r4
@base = http://example.org/fhir/oru2fhir

### Business JSON → Organization R5 (markdown description)
POST {{organizationR5}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

< ./json/organisation-metier.json

### Expected error: Organization.active is not a boolean
POST {{organizationR5}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

< ./json/organisation-metier-invalide.json

### HL7 v2 PID → FR Core INS Patient
POST {{frCorePatient}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ../demo/oie-init/data/samples/04-hl7v2-pid-fr-core-ins/input.er7

### FHIR Patient → FML normalization
POST {{fhirPatient}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

< ../demo/oie-init/data/samples/05-fhir-patient-normalization/input.json

### ADT A31 selects its FML map and logical model
POST {{dynamicAdt}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ../demo/oie-init/data/samples/18-adt-patient-dynamic-fml/adt-a31.er7

### 1. Complete example: the response is a transaction Bundle (12 entries)
# charset=UTF-8: without it, the HTTP listener reads ISO-8859-1 and corrupts accents.
POST {{oru}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-labo.er7

### 2. A single result, without encounter or specimen (4 entries)
POST {{oru}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-minimal.er7

### Structured diagnostic: boolean conversion fails, FHIR validation disabled
POST {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/test
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./api/diagnostic-error.json

### An absent optional value requires an explicit guard in the expression
# msg.optional.gender throws TypeError; msg.optional && msg.optional.gender omits the element.
POST {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/test
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./api/typeerror-error.json

### Preview trace: skipped condition, absent value, conversion and constant
POST {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/test
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./api/trace-preview.json

### A SQL XML row from the patient business table to ExampleLabPatient
POST {{sqlPatient}}
Content-Type: application/xml; charset=UTF-8

< ./xml/patient-result-sql.xml

### CSV cleanup and mapping to a collection of ten Patients
POST {{csvCollection}}
Content-Type: text/csv; charset=UTF-8

< ./csv/patients-metier-10.csv

### Two laboratory Bundles: transaction response; document in bundleDocument and destination 2
POST {{labo}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-labo.er7

### 3. Missing birth date: rejected by the Patient profile, empty response (message in ERROR)
POST {{oru}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ./hl7v2/oru-r01-sans-date-de-naissance.er7

### 4. Latest channel messages, with status and any error
GET {{oie}}/channels/{{channel}}/messages?limit=3&includeContent=true
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Accept: application/xml

### 5. Plugin: profiles from the example IG
GET {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/profiles?fhirVersion=R4&profiles={{ig}}
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI

### 6. Plugin: a profile with its snapshot (shown as a tree in the editor)
GET {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/structure?url={{base}}/StructureDefinition/ExampleLabObservation&fhirVersion=R4&profiles={{ig}}
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI

### 7. Plugin: IG ConceptMaps (without a terminology server: n/a)
GET {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/conceptMaps?server=n/a&profiles={{ig}}&fhirVersion=R4
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI

### 8. Plugin: local ConceptMap/$translate, GLU to LOINC
GET {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-mapper/translate?server=n/a&profiles={{ig}}&conceptMap={{base}}/ConceptMap/lab-codes-to-loinc&system={{base}}/CodeSystem/lab-codes&code=GLU&fhirVersion=R4
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI

### 9. Compare the Patient produced by FML and Mapper Transform
POST {{patient}}
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

< ../demo/oie-init/data/samples/restored/oru-patient.er7

### 10. The OIE logical model (OieMessage) received by the map for this message
POST {{oie}}/extensions/fhir-fml/source
Authorization: {{auth}}
X-Requested-With: OpenAPI
Content-Type: text/plain

{"message": "MSH|^~\\&|LAB|EXAMPLE-LAB|OIE|EXAMPLE-HOSP|20260114171908||ORU^R01^ORU_R01|MSG-0002|P|2.5.1\rPID|1||100001^^^EXAMPLE^PI||MARTIN^CLAIRE^ANNE^^Mme^^L||19800215|F", "dataType": "HL7V2"}
